Modified by Antony Vo (2026-11-26): the Swift conversion code was ported
to C# for Mac Song Manager. The port converts PC custom songs to Mac.
Chart entries are re-keyed in place (compressed payload, IV, and the
56-byte signature stay put). Aggregate-graph paths are updated on the
raw bytes. Rename schemes and app-id replacement from rocksmithconvert
are not part of this port. The key and IV bytes are not in this source
tree; the user supplies a keys file. Official packages, including
songs.psarc, and packages with no toolkit.version marker are refused.
